{"2928690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wandness: WandCraft Survivor", "steam_appid": 2928690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft wands, create synergies, battle monsters, and survive. Dive into the depths of magic crafting in Wandness, where you'll forge spells from magical components and elemental gems for endless combinations. Explore procedurally generated dungeons, defeat bosses, and unleash your magic madness to overcome the darkness that threatens to rule the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft Spells</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix over 50 magical components to make unique and powerful wands that change how over 20 projectiles behave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928690/extras/b03719a894ccb86264574087b64bfa27.poster.avif?t=1764821350\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928690/extras/b03719a894ccb86264574087b64bfa27.webm?t=1764821350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928690/extras/b03719a894ccb86264574087b64bfa27.mp4?t=1764821350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create Synergies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use elemental gems in wands, combined with their class, to make a lot of powerful combinations that work well to power your attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928690/extras/d2073bfda64cf95128244a8cd66a3c88.poster.avif?t=1764821350\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928690/extras/d2073bfda64cf95128244a8cd66a3c88.webm?t=1764821350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928690/extras/d2073bfda64cf95128244a8cd66a3c88.mp4?t=1764821350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight off waves of enemies at each node until the portal recharges, letting you teleport safely to go deeper into the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928690/extras/33ec1c50f3f3477bd6be4701ec33e877.poster.avif?t=1764821350\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928690/extras/33ec1c50f3f3477bd6be4701ec33e877.webm?t=1764821350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928690/extras/33ec1c50f3f3477bd6be4701ec33e877.mp4?t=1764821350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎲 Randomized Gameplay from Infinite spells possibilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 A lot of synergies to discover between the elements and classes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ Defeat the darkness and survive the monster horde</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎲 Random Generated maps and encounters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⌛ 40-60 minutes action-packed sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928690/extras/cb4bf68b6f10763af6d94e43fbe34992.poster.avif?t=1764821350\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928690/extras/cb4bf68b6f10763af6d94e43fbe34992.webm?t=1764821350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft wands, create synergies, battle monsters, and survive. Dive into the depths of magic crafting in Wandness, where you'll forge spells from magical components and elemental gems for endless combinations. Explore procedurally generated dungeons, defeat bosses, and unleash your magic madness to overcome the darkness that threatens to rule the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft Spells</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix over 50 magical components to make unique and powerful wands that change how over 20 projectiles behave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928690/extras/b03719a894ccb86264574087b64bfa27.poster.avif?t=1764821350\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928690/extras/b03719a894ccb86264574087b64bfa27.webm?t=1764821350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928690/extras/b03719a894ccb86264574087b64bfa27.mp4?t=1764821350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create Synergies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use elemental gems in wands, combined with their class, to make a lot of powerful combinations that work well to power your attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstat